roux('historical-4ff024a9e7c9aee6145827c2','Sauce Blanche — Butter and Vinegar',113,4,[water(120)],6,'A lightly thickened butter sauce is sharpened with white wine vinegar and coarse pepper.',season=[salt(1),pepper(.3)],finish=[vinegar(15)],notes='The sauce base is simmered before adding vinegar, replacing the source’s instruction never to boil uncooked flour. The half-spoon flour amount is a modern 4 g choice.',mode='slurry')
r=roux('historical-edac6ffd74d450db40a5738c','French Melted Butter with Vinegar and Nutmeg',113,8,[water(75)],6,'A concentrated butter sauce gains a mild vinegar tang and a small amount of nutmeg.',season=[salt(1)],finish=[vinegar(7.5),nutmeg()],notes='Both source versions have the same butter/flour/water/vinegar formula. The flour base now simmers before the acidic finish; 75 ml water is a modern choice for the ambiguous half-gill.',mode='slurry')
roux('historical-52f41bf29ae0a347f4c4a86a','Melted Butter — Flour-Dusted Method',113,5,[water(60)],6,'Butter and a small amount of flour form a rich pouring sauce with a little water.',notes='The wineglass and dusting of flour are assigned 60 ml and 5 g. Two source versions converge on this modern saucepan formula: the covered water-bath variant is replaced with controlled direct heat so the flour can simmer. Both source credits are retained.',mode='slurry')
roux('historical-3b3ae96ff5fc57da1ae07d58','Sauce Blanche — Stock and Butter',71,57,[stock(500)],8,'A thick, stock-based sauce is cooked from butter and flour, then finished with a fresh pat of butter.',season=[salt(2),sugar(1)],finish=[butter(5,'finish')],notes='Unsalted chicken stock is selected from the source’s broth-or-milk-and-water options; sauce remains deliberately thick. The final pat is 5 g.')
roux('historical-fa0eba15b6d4b3cdcff07903','Melted Butter — Concentrated Sauce',113,7,[water(45)],6,'A concentrated butter sauce uses very little water and a small flour thickener.',notes='The source’s short-water formula is retained. Heat gently and whisk; the mixture is richer and thicker than a milk sauce.',mode='slurry')
roux('historical-4e59f40a0ce22e484a6251db','Sos Biały (Dill and Sour-Cream Sauce)',14,8,[stock(240)],4,'Light stock sauce is finished with sour cream and chopped dill for a tangy herbal accompaniment.',finish=[ing('sour',60,'g','sour cream','Use 60 g full-fat plain yogurt; keep below a boil to reduce splitting.'),ing('dill',5,'g','finely chopped fresh dill','Use 5 g parsley for a different herbal flavor.')],notes='Missing stock, sour cream and dill amounts are supplied. Stock is unsalted chicken; fish or vegetable stock can be used in the same volume.')
